<title>UK: Morgan Stanley names Scott as research head Europe.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley names Scott as research head Europe.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said on Tuesday it had appointed Charles Scott as director of UK and European research, succeeding Theresa Bohl who has taken leave of absence.</p>
<p>Scott will move from the brokerage's institutional equity division where he was head of European sales, Morgan Stanley said in a statement.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44-171 542 7717</p>
